Package: ollama-speak
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Dr. Eric O. Flores <eric@florestoro.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk, alsa-utils
Recommends: sox
Homepage: https://github.com/drericflores/ollama-speak
Description: Local Ollama chat client with offline multilingual speech
 Ollama Speak is a Tk desktop client for local Ollama models. It supports
 streaming conversations and optional multilingual speech through separately
 installed Piper voices. Piper, Ollama, and voice models are not bundled.
